meta {
  name: Drop Year Partitions (Execute)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/tasks/partitions/drop-year?year=2026&table_name=ohlcv_1min&confirm=true
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  year: 2026
  table_name: ohlcv_1min
  confirm: true
}

docs {
  ⚠️⚠️⚠️ ACTUALLY DROP all partitions for a year ⚠️⚠️⚠️
  
  This PERMANENTLY DELETES DATA - USE WITH EXTREME CAUTION!
  
  Before running this:
  1. Run "Drop Year Partitions (Preview)" first to see what will be deleted
  2. Verify the partition list is correct
  3. Make sure you can backfill this data from Alpaca/Tradier
  4. Only then run this request
  
  Query Parameters (REQUIRED):
  - year: Year to drop partitions for (2020-2030)
  - table_name: Name of the partitioned table
  - confirm: MUST BE TRUE to execute (this is set to true)
  
  After dropping:
  1. Recreate partitions: POST /partitions/create?year=YYYY&table_name=ohlcv_1min
  2. Backfill data: POST /market-data/SPY/backfill with appropriate date range
  
  Example workflow to fix 2025 partitions:
  1. Preview: Drop Year Partitions (Preview) - confirm=false
  2. Execute: THIS REQUEST - confirm=true
  3. Recreate: Create Partitions for 2025
  4. Backfill: Backfill Dec 30, 2024 through current date
}
